msgstr "如织下针般滑2针，从左针织1针下针，将2个滑针套过它"

msgid "knit in back and front of same st, then pick up vertical strand that runs between those 2 sts and knit it through the back"
msgstr "在同一针的后线圈和前线圈各织一针下针，然后挑起这2针之间的竖线，织后线圈下针"

msgid "Insert right needle into third st on left needle and pass this st over first 2 sts on left needle; k1, yo, k1."
msgstr "将右针插入左针上的第3针，把它套过左针上的前2针；织下针、挂针、下针"

msgid "slip 1 st knitwise, k2 sts together from left needle, pass slipped stitch over"
msgstr "如织下针般滑1针，从左针将2针一起织下针，将滑针套过"

msgid "Knit 1 stitch wrapping yarn twice, then on next row drop extra wrap from needle"
msgstr "绕线两圈织1针，下一行时从针上放掉多绕的一圈"

msgid "Knit 1 stitch wrapping yarn 3 times, then on next row drop extra wraps from needle"
msgstr "绕线3圈织1针，下一行时从针上放掉多绕的圈"

msgid "k1, p1, k1 into same stitch"
msgstr "在同一针里织下针、上针、下针"

msgid "k1, leaving stitch on left hand needle, yo, k1 into same stitch"
msgstr "织1针下针，不要把线圈从左针上取下，挂针，再在同一针里织1针下针"

msgid "Knit 2 together"
msgstr "2针一起织下针"

msgid "Knit 3 together"
msgstr "3针一起织下针"

msgid "knit front and back of same st"
msgstr "在同一针的前线圈和后线圈各织1针下针"

msgid "knit on RS; purl on WS"
msgstr "正面织下针，反面织上针"

msgid "knit through back loop"
msgstr "织后线圈下针"

